{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "ecology免登本系统配置指南",
        "level": 2,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "e-cology免登本系统配置指南"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "注：由于此方案实现老版本e-cology免登本系统配置过于复杂，可联系集成组以第三方免登的方式实现e-cology免登本系统",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "strong",
              "attrs": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "场景",
        "level": 5,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "场景："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "      在e-cology门户页面集成登录元素，点击后免登到本系统（前提：e-cology用户配置的移动电话或电子邮件是本系统的登录账号，优先用移动电话免登）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "业务流",
        "level": 5,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "业务流："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "     本系统开放平台新建免登套件并审核通过 -> e-cology门户页面集成登录元素 -> 点击免登到本系统。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "详细操作步骤",
        "level": 5,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "详细操作步骤："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "一在本系统开放平台新建免登套件",
        "level": 6,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "一、在本系统开放平台新建免登套件"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "在本系统开放平台中新建e-cology免登本系统应用，审批通过后可看到app_key、app_secret。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.0.png",
            "alt": "image.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "二ecology项目配置",
        "level": 6,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "二、e-cology项目配置"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1.将本系统ip地址（120.26.103.173,121.40.74.89,120.26.103.174,120.26.103.175,121.40.74.90）配置到e-cology项目HrmWebserviceIP.properties配置文件中并重启。"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2.检查e-cology用户是否配置了移动电话或电子邮件（移动电话或电子邮件至少要配置一个并且是本系统的登录账号）:"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3.e-cology中的人员姓名必须和本系统的姓名一致"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.1.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4.检查web service是否已部署:"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "在浏览器中输入http://{ecology系统访问地址}/services，应显示如下页面（如: "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "http://E10环境地址/services）：",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "http://192.168.7.200:8080/services）：",
                "target": "_blank",
                "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
                "class": null
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.2.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "如果未出现上述页面，则web service未部署成功，请与e-cology项目人员联系。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "三在ecology系统集成登录",
        "level": 6,
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "三、在e-cology系统集成登录"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(1)到集成中心新建集成登录"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "      入口：登录e-cology系统->后端应用中心->集成中心->集成登录->新建"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.3.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(2)在集成中填写相关配置"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "要求："
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "    1).内网地址、外网地址固定填写："
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{OpenApiOrigin}/oauth2/ecologyToEteams",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "{OpenApiOrigin}/oauth2/ecologyToEteams",
                "target": "_blank",
                "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
                "class": null
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t2).请求方式必须为post；"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t3).登录系统编码必须为UTF-8； "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t4).账号参数名称必须为account，且必须选中\"使用ecology账号\"；  "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t5).密码参数名称必须为pwd，且必须选中\"使用ecology密码\"；  "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t6).部门参数名必须为dept，参数值选择“部门”；  "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t7).自定义参数名app_key，参数值选择“固定值”，从已审核免登套件查看并填写，如：83d45cdfa2077e92c06749ef3f01a354；  "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t8).自定义参数名app_security，参数值选择“固定值”，从已审核免登套件查看并填写，如：aa1101bf1ad02f59eebe73c54d678fb；  "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t9).单点登录地址：/interface/Entrance.jsp；  "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\t10).标识：后面步骤会使用到。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.4.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(3)在登录页面集成免登元素（前端实现方法一）"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "新建登录后页面入口：门户引擎->门户页面->登陆后门户"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.5.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "新建门户页面的要求："
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "    1).必须启用；"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "    2).页面地址如：http://ip/interface/Entrance.jsp?id=HR&module=workflow&hideHead=0&hideIM=0&redirect_uri=跳转地址（其中IP是用户的ec对应地址或者域名，id是步骤2中的标识，module是指向eteams的功能模块，其他几个参数为固定值）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.6.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "效果：点击配置的页面即可免登到本系统组织"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.7.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "（4）集成免登到工具菜单配置（前端实现方法二）"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "新建工具栏菜单入口：门户引擎->门户菜单->工具栏菜单"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.8.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "新建工具栏菜单的要求："
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "    1).必须启用；"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "    2).URL配置如：/interface/Entrance.jsp?id=HR&module=workflow&hideHead=0&hideIM=0&redirect_uri="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "https://跳转地址",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "{origin}",
                "target": "_blank",
                "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
                "class": null
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "（其中id是步骤2中的标识，module是指向eteams的功能模块，其他几个参数为固定值）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.9.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "效果图：点击配置的工具栏菜单即可免登到本系统组织"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.10.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "备注：如果出现如下情况，请参考后续的解决步骤："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f949873915010760705.11.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "步骤一：Chrome浏览器，地址栏输入chrome://flags/"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "步骤二：搜索\"SameSite by default cookies\""
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "步骤三：找到\"SameSite by default cookies\"和\"Cookies without SameSite must be secure\"，将这两项设置为Disable"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardbreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "步骤四：重启浏览器"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
